# Where the built marketing site and Zina look for the API.
#
# Vite bakes this in at build time. It lives here, committed, rather than being
# passed on the command line, because "remember to set VITE_API_BASE_URL" is not
# a thing anyone remembers: a bare `npm run build` fell back to the "/api"
# default and shipped a site whose every API call returned index.html. There is
# no secret in a hostname, and being wrong here is silent.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://loopital-api-fra.onrender.com
